  "body_markdown": "About us\n\nmeet Dr. ChrisMeet The TeamLivewell DifferenceOffice TourTechnologyJoin Our Team\n\nservices\n\ndCOEFull Mouth ReconstructionSedation Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nSmile MakeoverPorcelain VeneersNo Prep VeneersGum RecontouringTeeth WhiteningDental Bonding\n\nImplant Dentistry\n\nDental ImplantsSingle ImplantsImplant BridgesAll-on-X ImplantsLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nRestorative Dentistry\n\nDental CrownsInlays & OnlaysDental BridgesTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nOral Surgery\n\nBone GraftingRidge AugmentationTooth ExtractionSinus LiftWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nOrthodontics\n\nInvisalignBraces\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPreventive DentistryPreventive CleaningGum TherapyRoot Canal Therapy\n\nTMJ TreatmentDental Emergencies\n\nnew patient\n\nfirst visit & new examInsurance & FinancingBlog\n\nOur work\n\nSmile GalleryTestimonials\n\nContact\n\ncall (703) 690-0102Request An Appointment\n\nBook Now\n\n703-690-0102\n\nLivewell Difference\n\nmeet Dr. Chris\n\nMeet The Team\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nOffice Tour\n\nTechnology\n\nServices\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\nDCOE\n\nTMJ Treatment\n\nDental Emergencies\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nPreventive\n\nDental Bridges\n\nRoot Canal\n\nProfessional Dental Cleaning\n\nScaling & Root Planing\n\nAll General Dentistry services\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nPorcelain Veneers\n\nNo Prep Veneers\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nGum Recontouring\n\nAll Cosmetic Dentistry Services\n\nSingle Implants\n\nImplant Bridges\n\nAll-on-X Implants\n\nLocator-Retained Dentures\n\nAll Implant Dentistry Services\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nTooth Extraction\n\nSinus Lift\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nInvisalign\n\nBraces\n\nAll Orthodontics Services\n\nDental Crowns\n\nTooth-Colored Fillings\n\nDental Bonding\n\nInlays & Onlays\n\nAll Restorative Dentistry Services\n\nNew Patient\n\nfirst visit & new exam\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nBlog\n\nTestimonials\n\nSmile Gallery\n\nCALL US: (703) 690-0102\n\nBOOK AN APPOINTMENT\n\n320+\n\n5 Star Reviews\n\n\n# Sedation Dentistry in Fairfax Station, VA\n\n\nSleep through your visit with IV sedation or nitrous oxide\n\nGuided by Dr. Akhavan, board-certified anesthesiologist\n\nComfort built around you, not a one-size protocol\n\n\n## Meet Dr. Melody Akhavan, Your Sedation Specialist\n\n\nFor many patients, the idea of “going under” can feel intimidating. That’s why having someone like Dr. Melody Akhavan by your side makes all the difference. With more than 20 years of experience in anesthesia for dental and medical procedures, she has a calm, reassuring way of making even the most nervous patients feel safe, heard, and cared for.\n\nDr. Akhavan earned her medical degree from the State University of New York School of Medicine, completed her internship in Internal Medicine, and went on to a Residency in Anesthesiology at Winthrop University Hospital, where she served as Chief Resident. She is skilled in all forms of anesthesia, from gentle sedation to general anesthesia, and takes the time to tailor each plan to your specific health needs, comfort level, and treatment.\n\nHer care starts well before your procedure, with a thorough preoperative assessment, and continues until you’re fully awake and feeling well afterward. Her goal is simple: to make your experience as smooth and worry-free as possible, so you can focus on your health, not your fears.\n\nIn addition to serving as Anesthesiologist and Assistant Chief of Anesthesiology at Kaiser Permanente earlier in her career, Dr. Akhavan is now President and Lead Anesthesiologist at Capital Anesthesia Associates. We are truly honored to have her caring for our patients.\n\nWhen she’s not in the operating room, Dr. Akhavan enjoys spending time with her husband and three children, traveling, and giving back through non-profit work.\n\nWatch Now\n\n\n## Your Dental Care Should Be About You.\n\n\nThe heart of Livewell is built around patients. In-house dental lab, genuine hospitality, and a team that truly cares about you. This is what it means to be looked after from start to finish.\n\nWhether you are visiting for a routine cleaning or a full smile transformation, you will feel seen, supported, and cared for every step of the way.\n\n\n## Because Fear Shouldn't Stand Between You and Your Health\n\n\nIf dental anxiety has kept you from the chair for years, you know it affects more than your smile. It affects how you feel when you look in the mirror, whether you avoid certain foods, and the quiet worry that sits in the back of your mind when something does not feel right. That is why we have built an experience designed for comfort from the moment you walk in.\n\nIt affects more than your next appointment. Dental anxiety left untreated keeps people away for years, and problems that could have been caught early compound into much bigger ones.\n\nMost anxiety goes unaddressed. Not because solutions don't exist, but because most practices don't invest in building an environment where truly nervous patients feel safe enough to show up.\n\nThe right experience changes everything. When you know what to expect, who's beside you, and that you're in control, showing up becomes possible. And that's where better oral health begins.\n\n\n## The Difference You'll Feel Before We Even Start\n\n\nDr. Chris knows dental fear firsthand, he had a painful, phobia-inducing dental experience as a child. That’s why he’s spent years refining techniques to make injections virtually undetectable:\n\nWarming the anesthetic to body temperature\n\nUsing special distraction methods\n\nPerfecting gentle delivery so patients often don’t feel a thing\n\nMeet Dr. Chris\n\n\n## Wake Up With Your Smile\n\n\n\n### High Level of Comfort\n\n\nFor some, comfort items and gentle techniques are enough. For others, true peace of mind comes from knowing they can sleep through their treatment and wake up with a healthier smile.\n\n\n### IV Sedation\n\n\nIV Sedation – The deepest level of relaxation available in a dental office. Perfect for those with severe anxiety, complex treatment plans, or anyone wanting everything done in one visit.\n\n\n### Nitrous Oxide\n\n\nA lighter option that eases tension and wears off quickly—no downtime needed.\n\n\n## Uncompromising Excellence\n\n\n\n## Ready to Experience the Livewell Difference?\n\n\nWe welcome patients who value doing things right the first time, with intention, purpose, and partnership. If you have been looking for something different, this is it.\n\nExperience The Livewell Difference\n\nHear From Our Patients\n\nWho is a good candidate for sedation dentistry?\n\nSedation dentistry is a good fit for patients with dental anxiety or phobia, anyone who needs several procedures completed in one visit, patients with a strong gag reflex, or anyone who simply prefers to have no memory of the treatment. Dr. Chris will discuss which option makes the most sense based on your health history and what is planned for your visit.\n\nWhat types of sedation are available at Livewell Dental?\n\nThree options: IV sedation (deepest level of in-office relaxation, ideal for significant anxiety or complex treatment), nitrous oxide (lighter, wears off quickly, no downtime needed), and comfort-first techniques including warmed anesthetic, distraction methods, and a gentle delivery approach that makes injections virtually undetectable for most patients.\n\nWill I be unconscious with IV sedation?\n\nMost patients have little to no memory of the procedure with IV sedation. You will be in a deeply relaxed state and monitored the entire time by Dr. Melody Akhavan. You will need someone to drive you home and should plan to rest for the rest of the day.\n\nHow long does recovery take after IV sedation?\n\nMost patients feel alert within a few hours. You will need a designated driver and should avoid operating machinery for the rest of the day. Nitrous oxide wears off within minutes and typically requires no downtime at all.\n\n\n### Frequently Asked Questions\n\n\nContact Us\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n9027 Silverbrook Rd Ste. F\n\nFairfax Station, VA 22039\n\n\n### Contact\n\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMon-Tue: 8am-5pm\n\nWed-Thu: 8am-4pm\n\nFri: 8am-1pm\n\n\n### Connect\n\n\nServing Fairfax Station and the Greater Northern Virginia Area\n\nCopyright © TEXT-YEAR Livewell Dental\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure\n\nConsent Preferences",
